{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066520/extras/9270e07ac3fff18371e04be9bb3cb905.poster.avif?t=1767491366\" width=1000 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066520/extras/9270e07ac3fff18371e04be9bb3cb905.webm?t=1767491366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>BETCOIL is a five-ball roulette rogue-lite. Stack mementos and balls, place your bets, spin the wheel, and survive one more day.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066520/extras/d1fa5675b48bb1b181c7c6b128b90610.avif?t=1767491366\" width=1560 height=569 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the spirit of Clover Pit, Balatro, and Buckshot Roulette, it forges its own dieselpunk identity. Each day, the lethal loop resets: place your bets, spin the wheel, grab the mementos you want, and come back a little stronger. With five-ball roulette, 150+ rule-bending mementos, and 50 ball variants, no run plays the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066520/extras/c0ef4baefd683a395c9d83b6391d06aa.avif?t=1767491366\" width=1216 height=166 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066520/extras/47c11ad96deb4f13b23343dfb90634b0.poster.avif?t=1767491366\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066520/extras/47c11ad96deb4f13b23343dfb90634b0.webm?t=1767491366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066520/extras/47c11ad96deb4f13b23343dfb90634b0.mp4?t=1767491366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 150+ rule-bending mementos and 50 ball variants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deadly roulette rogue-lite game where every spin pulls you deeper.\u2028</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five-ball roulette core with a single combined payout.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic roulette bets adapted to five-ball play.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rusty, dieselpunk room filled with mystery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066520/extras/c10c5f76c02272203f13e1b97aa4895f.poster.avif?t=1767491366\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066520/extras/c10c5f76c02272203f13e1b97aa4895f.webm?t=1767491366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066520/extras/c10c5f76c02272203f13e1b97aa4895f.mp4?t=1767491366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LET THE GAME BEGIN!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4066520?t=1767491366","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066520/60935848ddf33608a62bd632438b2e248fed15d6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767491366","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066520/5c4d4bbfc2c70e8d5c34132ed49a6eeb3eb6d3ec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767491366","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_